        "original_id": "08ee65ac-1052-53b2-8469-4823c829ee36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Paulson, Merritt Wever, Chris Messina, Rich Sommer, Alexie Gilmore, Natalie Gold, Maryann Plunkett\n- TV Series: American Horror Story, Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip, New Girl, The Walking Dead\n- Episode: Blood Bath\n- Film: Fairhaven\n- Organizations: FX, NBC\n- Awards: Golden Globe Award\n\nFacts:\n- From 2006 to 2007, Sarah Paulson played Harriet Hayes in the NBC comedy-drama series Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\n- From 2006 to 2007, Sarah Paulson received her first Golden Globe Award nomination for Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\n- From 2006 to 2007, Merritt Wever played Suzanne in Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\n- In 2013, Merritt Wever played Elizabeth in New Girl.\n- On December 3, 2014, Blood Bath premiered on FX as the eighth episode of the anthology television series American Horror Story.\n- Blood Bath was notable as the first episode of American Horror Story that series veteran Sarah Paulson missed since the show's beginning.\n- The film Fairhaven starred Sarah Paulson, Chris Messina, Rich Sommer, Alexie Gilmore, Natalie Gold, and Maryann Plunkett.\n- From 2015 to 2016, Merritt Wever played Denise Cloyd in The Walking Dead.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
